bugfixing. The three games will be packaged into one launcher, with tons of extra stuff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also experience the endless runner minigame &quot;Imprisoned For Time&quot;, and tons of extras in the featured playable launcher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>H</strong>ow <strong>I</strong>t <strong>W</strong>orks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon starting this game, you will open up the Launcher, an <i>interactable</i> world set in some public toilets where the Assistant Director has done some business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the three doors to access three different RPGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and drop characters around! Try shaking the window too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the clock on the wall to access &quot;Imprisoned For Time&quot;, an endless runner minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the Rubbish Bin to access Extras (like concept art).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>W</strong>hat <strong>Y</strong>ou <strong>G</strong>et</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Norman Jones</strong> is a salesman sent to a remote, rural village, where he is tasked with selling vacuum cleaners to earn a promotion from The Boss!<br>&quot;Fight&quot; for that sweet deal,\u00a0 explore the land and unravel the mysteries underpinning the company...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professor Frippel</strong> is a scientist with a new invention to showcase! When it backfires, all scientists in town are turned into mice and end up on a strange alien planet! <br> Battle your way through 3 areas (or dungeons) and collect parts to fix their ship! What revelations await them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miodesopsia</strong> is an experimental game about the protagonist's last few minutes of life following an accident in the bathtub. Following judgement carried out by a being that calls herself &quot;The Archon&quot;, a brief intermission leads to exploring a dreamlike afterlife.<br>Collect souls, and pave your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imprisoned For Time </strong>follows Timothy T. Timesworth, a chronologist who dared mess with the order of TIME and was rightfully punished for his transgression.  <br>Run endlessly and get that high score! Our token ACTION game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614300/extras/51337308d1057e6e25bb95b5a738ff1d.avif?t=1773614820\" width=544 height=32 /></span></p>","developers":["Ufo Pizza Productions","Zero Point Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614300/f8c3a979de2c113cc0f75fc5d57cb15cbda768b5/header.jpg?t=1773614820","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3614300/1559298377/33872107fd6c1ed3dcd6aa42692a99ed7942c2fc/1758836154/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758839715","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3614300/1559298377/33872107fd6c1ed3dcd6aa42692a99ed7942c2fc/1758836154/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758839715","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3614300/1559298377/33872107fd6c1ed3dcd6aa42692a99ed7942c2fc/1758836154/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758839715","id":257206423,"name":"AsRPG Collection Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257206423/342737233fa072d915fca67d253d05da8be4a738/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758839715"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3614300/857240/b143f8cac10d187c9469344bccc36c8636b566d1/1750452779/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758839716","dash_h264":"https://vi